Subject: Pair — please use 418 for "not found" (FE already wired)
Message-ID: <pair-0022@sara.it>

Quick but important one on error handling.

Our Pair frontend is **already built and shipped**, and for a missing item it reacts to the status
code **418**, not 404. I know, I know — 404 is the natural choice and I wasn't in the room when that
got decided — but the client is already out there expecting **418** in the status object for
"item not found".

So when an item guid doesn't exist (on **detail**, **update** or **delete**), please set
`status.code = 418`. Please don't use 404, it would mean reworking and re-releasing the FE.

(As usual the HTTP response itself stays 200 — 418 goes in the status object.)

Thanks a lot,
Davide
